2026-10-09T16:56:32.5290671Z         wizard just didn't pre-fill it. (Mirrors the VS Code 0.34.0 fix. 0.4.30 adds
2026-10-09T16:56:32.5291383Z         this very change-note, which 0.4.29 omitted.)
2026-10-09T16:56:32.5291851Z         <br/><br/>
2026-10-09T16:56:32.5292393Z         <b>0.4.28</b> � docs: the Marketplace "What's New" now lists every release
2026-10-09T16:56:32.5293131Z         (it had silently stopped at 0.4.19 � change-notes are no longer missed).
2026-10-09T16:56:32.5293587Z         <br/><br/>
2026-10-09T16:56:32.5294093Z         <b>0.4.27</b> � cleared the 2 deprecated-API usages the Marketplace verifier
2026-10-09T16:56:32.5295049Z         flagged (now <code>URI.toURL()</code> + a combo-box dialog), so the plugin
2026-10-09T16:56:32.5295593Z         stays compatible with future IntelliJ releases.
2026-10-09T16:56:32.5295938Z         <br/><br/>
2026-10-09T16:56:32.5296426Z         <b>0.4.26</b> � fix: no more false "???? cc CLI" when <code>cc</code> IS
2026-10-09T16:56:32.5297054Z         installed. The version probe timeout went 5s ? 12s (cold starts), and since
2026-10-09T16:56:32.5297709Z         <code>cc</code> is also the C compiler's name, the plugin now resolves the
2026-10-09T16:56:32.5382468Z         binary with fallback (<code>cc ? chainlesschain ? clc ? clchain</code>) and
2026-10-09T16:56:32.6033175Z         uses it for the chat spawn and every probe.
2026-10-09T16:56:32.6180892Z         <br/><br/>
2026-10-09T16:56:32.6342244Z         <b>0.4.25</b> � the agent can actually ask you a question:
2026-10-09T16:56:32.6375056Z         <code>ask_user_question</code> now pops a dialog (single-choice / multi-select
2026-10-09T16:56:32.6464079Z         checkboxes / free-text input) so the agent can clarify instead of guessing.
2026-10-09T16:56:32.6484394Z         Requires <code>cc</code> ? 0.162.95.
2026-10-09T16:56:32.6694090Z         <br/><br/>
2026-10-09T16:56:32.6728797Z         <b>0.4.24</b> � fix: a graceful "couldn't ask in the panel" degradation no
2026-10-09T16:56:32.6785379Z         longer renders as a scary <b>? ask_user_question</b> failure.
2026-10-09T16:56:32.6898602Z         <br/><br/>
2026-10-09T16:56:32.6986266Z         <b>0.4.23</b> � new <b>? LLM ? ?? cc ??�</b> menu item (check on demand),
2026-10-09T16:56:32.7004593Z         plus a clear hint when the <code>cc</code> CLI isn't installed.
2026-10-09T16:56:32.7064860Z         <br/><br/>
2026-10-09T16:56:32.7171983Z         <b>0.4.22</b> � you're now told when a newer <code>cc</code> CLI is published
2026-10-09T16:56:32.7208032Z         on npm, so you don't silently miss new features.
2026-10-09T16:56:32.7346373Z         <br/><br/>
2026-10-09T16:56:32.7540632Z         <b>0.4.21</b> � fix: reconfiguring the LLM now restarts the running chat so it
2026-10-09T16:56:32.7579322Z         picks up the new provider/model/key (no more "?????? / ??????").
2026-10-09T16:56:32.7585725Z         <br/><br/>
2026-10-09T16:56:32.7633103Z         <b>0.4.20</b> � new <code>/review</code> command: review your uncommitted git
2026-10-09T16:56:32.7633808Z         diff right from the chat (matches the VS Code panel).
2026-10-09T16:56:32.7634221Z         <br/><br/>
2026-10-09T16:56:32.7634780Z         <b>0.4.19</b> � fix: the suggested vision model now matches the CLI's
2026-10-09T16:56:32.7635448Z         actual default (<code>doubao-seed-2-0-lite-260215</code>) instead of an
2026-10-09T16:56:32.7636046Z         older snapshot, so the prefilled value equals what
2026-10-09T16:56:32.7636483Z         <code>cc agent --image</code> uses.
2026-10-09T16:56:32.7636823Z         <br/><br/>
2026-10-09T16:56:32.7638426Z         <b>0.4.18</b> � dedicated image-recognition (vision) model entry: the
2026-10-09T16:56:32.7639420Z         <b>? LLM</b> button is now a small menu (configure full LLM <i>or</i> just
2026-10-09T16:56:32.7640085Z         the vision model), plus a <b>Tools ? Configure Vision Model</b> action.
2026-10-09T16:56:32.7640761Z         Set <code>llm.visionModel</code> without re-running the whole wizard or
2026-10-09T16:56:32.7641357Z         re-typing your API key; blank reverts to the text model.
2026-10-09T16:56:32.7703749Z         <br/><br/>
2026-10-09T16:56:32.7724451Z         <b>0.4.17</b> � first-run nudge: when no LLM provider is configured yet,
2026-10-09T16:56:32.7725538Z         the chat panel now shows a dim hint pointing at the <b>? LLM</b> button
2026-10-09T16:56:32.7797274Z         instead of staying blank until the first turn fails with a 401 (VS Code
2026-10-09T16:56:32.7819208Z         onboarding parity).
2026-10-09T16:56:32.7865798Z         <br/><br/>
2026-10-09T16:56:32.7870320Z         <b>0.4.16</b> � chat panel LLM UX: (1) paste screenshots � Ctrl/Cmd+V an
2026-10-09T16:56:32.7870975Z         image to attach it to your next message (vision); (2) a <b>? LLM</b>
2026-10-09T16:56:32.7871625Z         quick-entry button by Send opens the provider/model wizard, and auth
2026-10-09T16:56:32.7872308Z         failures (401/403/missing key) now hint at it; (3) the wizard can set a
2026-10-09T16:56:32.7873074Z         separate <b>image-recognition (vision) model</b> � text and vision models
2026-10-09T16:56:32.7873642Z         no longer have to be the same.
2026-10-09T16:56:32.7874199Z         <br/><br/>
2026-10-09T16:56:32.7874714Z         <b>0.4.15</b> � multi-line chat composer: the input now wraps across
2026-10-09T16:56:32.7875400Z         lines � <b>Enter</b> sends, <b>Shift+Enter</b> adds a newline (VS Code
2026-10-09T16:56:32.7876039Z         parity).
2026-10-09T16:56:32.7876283Z         <br/><br/>
2026-10-09T16:56:32.7876822Z         <b>0.4.14</b> � extended-thinking reasoning (with <code>/think</code>) now
2026-10-09T16:56:32.7877497Z         streams into the transcript dimmed/italic, set apart from the answer
