2026-10-09T16:56:32.7878251Z         <br/><br/>
2026-10-09T16:56:32.7878761Z         <b>0.4.13</b> � Markdown rendering in the chat transcript: fenced/inline
2026-10-09T16:56:32.7879368Z         <code>code</code> (monospace) and <b>bold</b> now render instead of raw
2026-10-09T16:56:32.7879982Z         markers (VS Code parity). Streaming stays plain, then snaps to styled.
2026-10-09T16:56:32.7880433Z         <br/><br/>
2026-10-09T16:56:32.7880915Z         <b>0.4.12</b> � "Fix with ChainlessChain" intention: on an error/warning
2026-10-09T16:56:32.7881833Z         line, Alt+Enter offers a quick-fix that seeds the chat with a fix request
2026-10-09T16:56:32.7882479Z         scoped to that file + those problems (VS Code parity).
2026-10-09T16:56:32.7882891Z         <br/><br/>
2026-10-09T16:56:32.7883501Z         <b>0.4.11</b> � slash-command autocomplete: typing <code>/</code> at the
2026-10-09T16:56:32.7884112Z         start of the chat input pops a chooser of the panel's commands
2026-10-09T16:56:32.7884770Z         (<code>/new</code>, <code>/compact</code>, <code>/think</code>, �),
2026-10-09T16:56:32.7885262Z         filtered as you type (VS Code parity).
2026-10-09T16:56:32.7885606Z         <br/><br/>
2026-10-09T16:56:32.7886054Z         <b>0.4.10</b> � fix: wrap the diff-review document reads
2026-10-09T16:56:32.7886611Z         (<code>openDiff</code>/<code>openMultiDiff</code>) in a read action.
