2026-10-09T17:00:30.1081299Z         <br/><br/>
2026-10-09T17:00:30.1095594Z         <b>0.4.23</b> � new <b>? LLM ? ?? cc ??�</b> menu item (check on demand),
2026-10-09T17:00:30.1147704Z         plus a clear hint when the <code>cc</code> CLI isn't installed.
2026-10-09T17:00:30.1149610Z         <br/><br/>
