2026-10-09T17:00:30.1199760Z         re-typing your API key; blank reverts to the text model.
2026-10-09T17:00:30.1200329Z         <br/><br/>
2026-10-09T17:00:30.1201014Z         <b>0.4.17</b> � first-run nudge: when no LLM provider is configured yet,
