2026-10-09T17:00:30.1203958Z         <br/><br/>
2026-10-09T17:00:30.1204631Z         <b>0.4.16</b> � chat panel LLM UX: (1) paste screenshots � Ctrl/Cmd+V an
2026-10-09T17:00:30.1205281Z         image to attach it to your next message (vision); (2) a <b>? LLM</b>
2026-10-09T17:00:30.1206418Z         quick-entry button by Send opens the provider/model wizard, and auth
