2026-10-09T17:00:30.1222861Z         <br/><br/>
2026-10-09T17:00:30.1223552Z         <b>0.4.14</b> � extended-thinking reasoning (with <code>/think</code>) now
2026-10-09T17:00:30.1224373Z         streams into the transcript dimmed/italic, set apart from the answer
