2026-10-09T17:00:30.1225459Z         <br/><br/>
2026-10-09T17:00:30.1226134Z         <b>0.4.13</b> � Markdown rendering in the chat transcript: fenced/inline
2026-10-09T17:00:30.1226923Z         <code>code</code> (monospace) and <b>bold</b> now render instead of raw
2026-10-09T17:00:30.1227726Z         markers (VS Code parity). Streaming stays plain, then snaps to styled.
2026-10-09T17:00:30.1228315Z         <br/><br/>
2026-10-09T17:00:30.1229303Z         <b>0.4.12</b> � "Fix with ChainlessChain" intention: on an error/warning
2026-10-09T17:00:30.1230329Z         line, Alt+Enter offers a quick-fix that seeds the chat with a fix request
2026-10-09T17:00:30.1231037Z         scoped to that file + those problems (VS Code parity).
2026-10-09T17:00:30.1231951Z         <br/><br/>
2026-10-09T17:00:30.1233557Z         <b>0.4.11</b> � slash-command autocomplete: typing <code>/</code> at the
2026-10-09T17:00:30.1263835Z         start of the chat input pops a chooser of the panel's commands
