2026-10-09T17:00:30.1265617Z         filtered as you type (VS Code parity).
2026-10-09T17:00:30.1266113Z         <br/><br/>
2026-10-09T17:00:30.1266722Z         <b>0.4.10</b> � fix: wrap the diff-review document reads
2026-10-09T17:00:30.1267453Z         (<code>openDiff</code>/<code>openMultiDiff</code>) in a read action.
