2026-10-09T17:00:30.1270631Z         <br/><br/>
2026-10-09T17:00:30.1271334Z         <b>0.4.9</b> � fix: the chat tool window now deterministically uses the
2026-10-09T17:00:30.1272316Z         LLM provider you configured (<code>cc config</code> / Configure LLM),
