2026-10-09T17:00:30.1277210Z         <code>Anthropic error: 401</code> when another provider is configured.
2026-10-09T17:00:30.1277713Z         <br/><br/>
2026-10-09T17:00:30.1278302Z         <b>0.4.8</b> � <code>/compact</code> in the chat tool window (Claude-Code
2026-10-09T17:00:30.1279035Z         IDE parity): trims the live conversation history between turns (no extra
2026-10-09T17:00:30.1280038Z         LLM call) and reports the tokens saved. Mirrors the VS Code 0.31.0
2026-10-09T17:00:30.1280489Z         feature.
2026-10-09T17:00:30.1280763Z         <br/><br/>
2026-10-09T17:00:30.1281304Z         <b>0.4.7</b> � cleared the remaining API-compatibility flags the Plugin
2026-10-09T17:00:30.1281969Z         Verifier reported on 2026.x: the @-mention list renderer no longer uses a
2026-10-09T17:00:30.1282644Z         scheduled-for-removal helper, and the deprecated terminal customizer was
2026-10-09T17:00:30.1283373Z         removed (a <code>cc</code> you run in a terminal still auto-connects via the
2026-10-09T17:00:30.1283948Z         bridge's discovery lockfile).
2026-10-09T17:00:30.1284601Z         <br/><br/>
2026-10-09T17:00:30.1285255Z         <b>0.4.6</b> � newer-IDE compatibility: removed the last deprecated-API
2026-10-09T17:00:30.1285992Z         usages (terminal-process listener + provider-chooser dialog). Plugin Verifier
2026-10-09T17:00:30.1286729Z         reports no internal / scheduled-for-removal / deprecated API usage on 2025.2.
2026-10-09T17:00:30.1287239Z         <br/><br/>
2026-10-09T17:00:30.1287850Z         <b>0.4.5</b> � reverted the experimental 0.4.4 <code>getTerminalOutput</code>
2026-10-09T17:00:30.1288568Z         tool: the terminal API it used is not stable across IDE versions and caused
2026-10-09T17:00:30.1289235Z         errors on some builds. Everything else is unchanged from 0.4.3.
2026-10-09T17:00:30.1289710Z         <br/><br/>
2026-10-09T17:00:30.1290210Z         <b>0.4.3</b> � the <code>@</code>-mention symbol completion now covers
2026-10-09T17:00:30.1290908Z         <b>methods/functions</b> too (not just classes) � type a method name to
2026-10-09T17:00:30.1291455Z         reference the file where it's defined.
2026-10-09T17:00:30.1291822Z         <br/><br/>
2026-10-09T17:00:30.1292403Z         <b>0.4.2</b> � the <code>@</code>-mention popup now includes project class
2026-10-09T17:00:30.1293034Z         symbols (type a class name to reference the file where it's defined),
2026-10-09T17:00:30.1293667Z         alongside <code>@selection</code>/<code>@diagnostics</code> and files.
2026-10-09T17:00:30.1294102Z         <br/><br/>
2026-10-09T17:00:30.1294622Z         <b>0.4.1</b> � expanded the plugin description / what's-new (no functional
2026-10-09T17:00:30.1295159Z         change since 0.4.0).
2026-10-09T17:00:30.1295455Z         <br/><br/>
2026-10-09T17:00:30.1295867Z         <b>0.4.0</b> � VS Code feature parity.
2026-10-09T17:00:30.1296226Z         <ul>
2026-10-09T17:00:30.1296740Z           <li>Multi-conversation <b>tabs</b> (one agent per tab, resume across restarts).</li>
2026-10-09T17:00:30.1297687Z           <li><b>Approval modes</b> (<code>/auto</code>�<code>/bypass</code>�<code>/normal</code>)
2026-10-09T17:00:30.1298605Z               and <b>extended thinking</b> (<code>/think</code>�<code>/ultrathink</code>�<code>/think-off</code>),
2026-10-09T17:00:30.1299701Z               plus <code>/new</code> <code>/stop</code> <code>/cost</code> <code>/context</code>
2026-10-09T17:00:30.1300349Z               <code>/plan</code> <code>/approve</code> <code>/reject</code>.</li>
2026-10-09T17:00:30.1301567Z           <li><b>Interactive plan &amp; approval cards</b> (Approve/Deny buttons).</li>
